{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"ppc","type":"text","text":"## Power Plant Controller\n\nFast-Loop Control.\n\n*Real-time Controller (PLC/PAC). Executes Volt-Var, Freq-Watt curves. 10ms loop time.*","x":400,"y":1100,"width":250,"height":220,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"pcs_dsp","type":"text","text":"## PCS Controller (DSP)\n\nMicrocode & Control Loops.\n\n*Core processing engine. Executes Grid Synchronization Algorithms (PLL), Inner Current Loops, and Outer Voltage Loops via embedded DSP Microcode.*","x":650,"y":1400,"width":250,"height":200,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"gps","type":"text","text":"## PTP Master Clock\n\nTime Source (Stratum 1).\n\n*GPS/GNSS. Distributes IEEE 1588v2 PTP time to switches and IEDs for sequence-of-events recording.*","x":-190,"y":590,"width":250,"height":240,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"derms_forecast","type":"text","text":"## DERMS Forecasting Engine\n\nPredictive modeling.\n\n*Uses weather data and historical load profiles to predict generation potential and update limits.*","x":-315,"y":-240,"width":250,"height":325,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"retailer","type":"text","text":"## Retailer Trading Desk\n\nMarket Arbitrage & Dispatch.\n\n*Generates dispatch signals based on spot price high/lows. Sends \"Charge/Discharge\" commands via API.*","x":-225,"y":-680,"width":250,"height":270,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"derms_core","type":"text","text":"## DERMS Orchestrator\n\nDER Management Core.\n\n*Aggregates distributed assets. Validates commercial availability against technical capability.*","x":275,"y":-240,"width":250,"height":325,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"meter_pcc","type":"text","text":"## HV Revenue Meter\n\nSettlement Metering.\n\n*Ion 8650. DNP3/MV90 over Ethernet. Measures PQ (Harmonics/Sags) and Energy flows.*","x":1685,"y":1400,"width":250,"height":200,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"firewall","type":"text","text":"## Secure Edge Firewall\n\nPerimeter Defense (Zone 3.5).\n\n*Deep Packet Inspection (DPI) for Modbus/DNP3. Terminates IPSec tunnels. Filters traffic between Corporate and OT.*","x":400,"y":200,"width":250,"height":280,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"switch_core","type":"text","text":"## Core L3 Switch\n\nInter-VLAN Routing.\n\n*Ruggedized Core. Manages VRFs. Routes between OT DMZ, Station Bus, and Management Bus. ACL Enforcement point.*","x":400,"y":590,"width":250,"height":240,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"switch_station","type":"text","text":"## Station Bus Switch (L2)\n\nCritical Control Traffic.\n\n*VLAN 100 (GOOSE/SV), VLAN 101 (MMS). Priority QoS (802.1p) for Trip signals (<4ms latency).*","x":400,"y":830,"width":250,"height":140,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"bms_master","type":"text","text":"## Master BMS\n\nSystem Aggregator.\n\n*Manages DC Contactors. Aggregates rack telemetry. Hardwired E-Stop loop.*","x":150,"y":1690,"width":250,"height":140,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"dc_combiner","type":"text","text":"## DC Combiner\n\nDC Bus Aggregation.\n\n*Fuses and Load Break Switches. Connection point for multiple battery racks.*","x":320,"y":2120,"width":250,"height":235,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"adms_scada","type":"text","text":"## ADMS SCADA Front-End\n\nReal-time Grid Supervision.\n\n*Ingests telemetry via DNP3/ICCP. Provides operator situational awareness of the distribution network.*","x":775,"y":-240,"width":250,"height":325,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"tap_ids","type":"text","text":"## OT IDS Sensor\n\nPassive Detection.\n\n*Nozomi/Claroty Probe. Connected via SPAN port. Analyzes traffic patterns for anomalies and rogue commands.*","x":1125,"y":355,"width":250,"height":250,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"bastion","type":"text","text":"## Bastion Host (Citrix)\n\nVendor Remote Access.\n\n*Jump-host for third-party maintenance. Sessions are recorded and isolated from the OT network.*","x":-690,"y":200,"width":250,"height":240,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"radius","type":"text","text":"## AAA / RADIUS Server\n\nIdentity Management.\n\n*Enforces MFA and Role-Based Access Control (RBAC) for all remote sessions.*","x":-690,"y":590,"width":250,"height":240,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"rtu","type":"text","text":"## RTU / Gateway\n\nSCADA Concentrator.\n\n*Dual-homed. Maps Modbus (Physical Layer) to DNP3 (ADMS). Buffers 24hrs of data locally.*","x":-690,"y":1100,"width":250,"height":220,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"ups","type":"text","text":"## UPS System\n\nBackup Power.\n\n*Ensures 24V DC / 230V AC availability for Network Switches, PPC, and Firewalls.*","x":-690,"y":1400,"width":250,"height":200,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"aux_fss","type":"text","text":"## Fire Suppression\n\nSafety System.\n\n*Hardwired interlocks. Stat-X Aerosol generators. Inputs to PPC for immediate shutdown.*","x":-690,"y":1690,"width":250,"height":230,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"aux_hvac","type":"text","text":"## Thermal Mgmt\n\nCooling System.\n\n*Liquid Chillers. Modbus TCP connection to BMS for setpoint control.*","x":-690,"y":2015,"width":250,"height":210,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"bms_temp","type":"text","text":"## Thermal Sensors\n\nMultipoint NTC.\n\n*Direct contact temperature monitoring. Critical for thermal runaway detection.*","x":-690,"y":2285,"width":250,"height":210,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"battery_cells","type":"text","text":"## Lithium-Ion Racks\n\nStorage Modules.\n\n*Samsung/CATL Prismatic cells. Series connected for 1200-1500V DC.*","x":-690,"y":2550,"width":250,"height":200,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"bms_volts","type":"text","text":"## Cell Monitoring\n\nCMU / BMU.\n\n*Voltage/Temp sensing. Passive balancing logic. CAN Bus communication to Master BMS.*","x":150,"y":2870,"width":250,"height":250,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"pcs_igbt","type":"text","text":"## IGBT Stacks\n\nPower Bridge.\n\n*3-Phase Bridge. Converts DC to AC. Liquid cooled heatsinks.*","x":650,"y":2530,"width":250,"height":240,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"pcs_gate","type":"text","text":"## Gate Drivers\n\nIsolation Stage.\n\n*Opto-isolated drivers. Controls the IGBT gates. Desaturation protection.*","x":650,"y":2120,"width":250,"height":210,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"pcs_pwm","type":"text","text":"## PWM Generator\n\nSwitching Logic.\n\n*Space Vector PWM. 3-10kHz switching frequency generation.*","x":650,"y":1750,"width":250,"height":230,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"ac_filter","type":"text","text":"## LCL Filter\n\nSine Wave Filter.\n\n*Reduces THD (Total Harmonic Distortion) to <3%. Passive LC components.*","x":1250,"y":2880,"width":250,"height":240,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"lv_breaker","type":"text","text":"## LV AC Breaker\n\nProtection & Iso.\n\n*Air Circuit Breaker (ACB). Motorized charging. Trip unit communicates via Modbus.*","x":1250,"y":2120,"width":250,"height":210,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"transformer","type":"text","text":"## Step-Up Tx\n\n33kV Connection.\n\n*Dyn11 vector group. Oil-filled ONAN. Neutral earthing resistor (NER) connection.*","x":1685,"y":2550,"width":250,"height":240,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"pcs_pll","type":"text","text":"## PLL / Grid Sense\n\nSynchronization.\n\n*Fast detection of voltage angle/freq. Inputs from LV Breaker VT.*","x":1320,"y":1400,"width":250,"height":200,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"relay_pcc","type":"text","text":"## PCC Protection Relay\n\nInterconnection Protection.\n\n*SEL-751. Detects Faults/Islanding. Sends GOOSE trips to breakers. Connected to Station Bus.*","x":1000,"y":1100,"width":250,"height":220,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"ews","type":"text","text":"## Eng. Workstation (EWS)\n\nMaintenance Console.\n\n*Hardened Windows PC. Used for Relay Logic updates (AcSELerator) and PLC programming. Whitelisted apps only.*","x":1880,"y":830,"width":250,"height":270,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"switch_mgt","type":"text","text":"## O&M Access Switch (L2)\n\nManagement & Engineering.\n\n*VLAN 200. Connects EWS, HMI, and Device Management ports. 802.1X NAC enabled.*","x":1250,"y":765,"width":250,"height":270,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"historian","type":"text","text":"## Enterprise Historian\n\nBig Data Storage (PI/Timescale).\n\n*Archival of 1-second resolution telemetry for regulatory reporting and post-event fault analysis.*","x":1338,"y":-145,"width":325,"height":230,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"adms_apps","type":"text","text":"## ADMS Network Apps\n\nState Estimation & FLISR.\n\n*Calculates Power Flow, Thermal Limits, and Voltage profiles. Issues dynamic operating envelopes (DOEs).*","x":1251,"y":-600,"width":250,"height":275,"color":"4"}
	],
